      "content": "thanks for that. though it feels a bit one-sided for a town hall summary where people might feel unheard. i want to make sure i'm being fair to everyone attending. can you add a section that explains the specific arguments or concerns being raised by parents who are against the mandate? i need to show i understand why they are protesting so the meeting doesn't turn into a shouting match.",
